Modified-files statement (Apache-2.0 section 4(b))
-------------------------------------------------
Merlin changes files relative to vLLM v0.33.0. Those changes are by the Merlin
project, not the upstream vLLM authors. The fork adds or changes engine code for
FP8 QSA on sm_86, host-memory PLE offload, RecoverSSM, prefix-cache retention,
persistent top-k, prompt-logprob workspace bounds, compatibility checks,
launchers, tests, build configuration and documentation.

