files retain their applicable notices. Each modified upstream file, including
CMakeLists.txt and the modified csrc/ files, carries the line "Modified by the Merlin
project; see NOTICE." This central record supplements those notices.

Adapted third-party kernel code
-------------------------------
csrc/merlin/topk/persistent_topk.cuh adapts top-k kernel code from SGLang
v0.5.8 (sgl-kernel/csrc/elementwise/topk.cu, Apache-2.0,
https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang), which in turn derives from TileLang
(MIT, https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang), and from FlashInfer pull request
2215 (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer). The original
notices of those projects apply to the adapted portions.

