FlashInfer and templates
------------------------
FlashInfer (https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer), Apache-2.0, is an
external dependency. The 27B serving configuration uses FlashInfer 0.7.2.post1
with the Merlin sm_86 FP8 small-q verify-tile patch distributed under
release/patches/flashinfer-0.7.2.post1/ (the 0.7.0.post1 series under
release/patches/flashinfer-0.7.0.post1/ is kept for history). Applying that patch modifies the
installed FlashInfer files named by its diff headers; retain their original
copyright and licence notices.

The vendored froggeric Qwen-Fixed-Chat-Templates v22.5 template and Qwen's
underlying template retain their Apache-2.0 attribution:
  models/qwen38-27b/templates/NOTICE
Other bundled third-party code retains its own headers and licence terms.

